language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Requires exactly m values in x to take one of the values in v. All other values lie between 0 and 7. Print the array x.
given n : int(1..10)
given m : int(0..10)
given v : matrix indexed by [int(1..4)] of int(0..7)
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of int(0..7)

branching on [x]

such that
$ exactly m entries of x take one of the values in v
(sum i : int(1..n) . toInt(x[i] in toSet(v))) = m
